function [c] = eci2ecef(jd)
%ECI2ECEF  J2000 to the Earth-fixed frame: precession to the mean equator of date, then GMST (nutation and
%   polar motion left out).
%   jd: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   returns c: real[1][3][3] (passed a plain number)
%   Generated by tools/pcode.py from the pseudocode (trinetra-pcode/2); do not edit.
